# Theming & Design System

## Tokens
- ✅ Define colors, spacing, radius, typography as tokens
- ✅ Use `ThemeExtensions` for custom design tokens

## Usage
- ✅ No hardcoded colors/fonts in widgets
- ✅ Use theme text styles (`Theme.of(context).textTheme...`)
- ✅ Support dark mode + text scaling

## Components
- ✅ Shared UI components live in `shared/ui/`
- ✅ Components accept tokens/styles via theme, not hardcoded

## NEVER
- ❌ Inline hex colors across the codebase
- ❌ Custom fonts applied ad-hoc per screen
